title: Remove dead code
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Removes code that was no longer compiled or used:
    - `sc-network`: the private `protocol::message` module with the legacy pre-notification
      protocol and light client message types. Nothing used it anymore.
    - `polkadot-node-core-approval-voting`: the orphaned `approval_db/v1/tests.rs`, which was no
      longer part of the module tree.
    - Stale, undeclared weight files in the Westend and Rococo runtimes.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: none
